      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLASH AZARAT (2) has had two runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three but was solid when fourth last time at Bathurst. Has won when third-up before so should be fitter again. Has the benefit of a good draw and is a leading hope in what looks a suitable assignment. STUDLEIGH SUNRISE (3) has been good from the second line of late, finishing runner-up at Dubbo two back and fourth last start at this venue. Expect her to pose a serious challenge from a better draw. ALWAYSATTHEBEACH (7) is on the radar after solid fourths from wider draws in her last two outings at Wagga. Won her lone try at this distance and could threaten if she gets the gaps. GEOFFREY BEE (10) was held up last time but recorded a win and a placing in his other two starts this time in so is worth another chance.",
